  "description": "Mountain Bike, April 2007 - \"FOR THIN WALLETS: A bike with this much travel is hard to come by at this price. And the Comp has the same frame as Mongoose's twise-as-expensive Super. MORE FOR LESS: The Comp features air-sprung suspension with adjustable rebound, hydraulic disc brakes, an oversize bar/stem interface and splined bottom bracket interface.\" Mountain Bike Action, March 2007 - \"We've said, 'the Teocali is good news for the Mongoose faithful (and those new to the brand). For way less than $2500, you get a super-fun and super-capable trail bike. Riders who frequent rought and rocky trails will benefit the most from the FreeDrive rear suspension, but riders on smoother terrain don't have to pay a penalty in suspension bobbing or weight.' There are four models (one for women riders) from $1100 to $2300.\"",
